## 1. Product Overview
A comprehensive driver mobility platform integrated with factory admin panel for end-to-end delivery management, product scanning, geolocation verification, and digital proof of delivery.

This system enables factory logistics teams to manage delivery fleets with real-time tracking, compliance monitoring, and automated workflow enforcement, while providing drivers with a mobile-optimized interface for task execution.

Implementation context: this module is intended to be built inside the existing Flutter (BLoC) application and integrated with the existing Laravel + PostgreSQL backend running on Hetzner.

## 2. Core Features

### 2.1 User Roles
| Role | Registration Method | Core Permissions |
|------|---------------------|------------------|
| Driver | Admin-created account with mobile login | Scan products, track trips, upload receipts, manage vehicle logs, communicate with admin/clients |
| Factory Admin | System administrator access | Create driver accounts, set receipt mandatory flags, approve expense claims, view all trip data, manage compliance alerts |
| Client/Recipient | Mobile app login | Confirm delivery location, verify receipt of goods, provide digital signature/PIN |

### 2.2 Feature Module
Our driver app requirements consist of the following main pages:
1. **Home Dashboard**: Trip status tracking, current location, pending tasks, earnings summary.
2. **Product Scanning Page**: Barcode/QR scanning for product pickup and delivery verification.
3. **Trip Details Page**: Route navigation, delivery window timer, geolocation monitoring.
4. **Proof of Delivery Page**: PIN verification, photo capture, digital signature collection.
5. **Earnings & History Page**: Income breakdown, payment history, invoices, pending approvals.
6. **Vehicle Management Page**: Meter readings, receipt uploads, maintenance logs, document expiry tracking.
7. **Communication Center**: In-app chat, call history with admin and clients.
8. **Settings & Profile**: Vehicle information, document uploads, app preferences.

