## 3. Core Process
Main driver operation flow:
1. Driver receives trip assignment (status: Assigned)
2. Driver arrives at factory, scans product to pickup (status: Picked-Up → In-Transit)
3. App navigates to delivery location, monitors driver's proximity
4. Within 100m, scan button unlocks; driver scans product on arrival (status: Arrived)
5. Collects POD (PIN/photo/signature) from recipient, uploads debrief photos (status: Delivered)
6. Driver completes any mandatory receipt/meter entries, trip marked Completed
7. Expenses submitted for admin approval if optional, auto-processed if mandatory

